  "limitations": [
    "P05 integrated native evidence: the C16, C17 and C18 drivers ran against the single P05-prepared fixture bundle with AIRS_NATIVE_SUBJECT=P05 (native-<chunk>/, native-acceptance-<chunk>.json), merged by tools/native-acceptance/merge_phase.py into native-acceptance.json. The phase's one registered workload, C18's Gateway streaming and charts (T20), was re-measured on that bundle and recorded under its own name (workload-perf-C18.json); xtask's workload_evidence() reads the per-chunk record in a phase.",
    "D034: C16 first completed on an 8/10 review under the owner rule (21266fe) and was raised to a passing 9/10 review on the integrated tree before this phase review (raised commit 1811d43; follow-ups in docs/planning/reviews/C16/follow-ups.md). C17 (250a8ce, attempt-03) and C18 (9b5f2ac, attempt-04) completed on passing 9/10 reviews and needed no raise.",
    "Mutation probes: the C16, C17 and C18 probe sets were re-run with the hardened harness on this phase tree (results.json 'inputs' bind each run to the SHA-256 of every mutated source); each mutation is credited only when its named test fails. All 133 were caught (C16 33/33, C17 52/52, C18 48/48). Counts are in each chunk's mutation-probes/probes.log.",
    "This packet's diff is measured from the P04 completion commit (8d5d436).",
    "No real product endpoint is called before C25. The AI Gateway management, admin, IAM and runtime (inference, files, usage, logs) planes are synthetic: tools/native-acceptance/mgmt_server.py (native) and the TLS fixtures in crates/desktop-core/tests/gateway_reads, gateway_changes and gateway_inference (integration), answering in the SDK's Gateway contract shapes at the production paths. Fixture builds only; signed packages are C26. Live Gateway qualification is not claimed.",
    "Recorded scope decisions: D042 (Gateway reads through the SDK's gateway feature with typed operations), D043 (reviewed Gateway changes and provisioning outcomes; MCP servers and integration writes beyond it are C22), D044 (Gateway inference, observation and Home/Inbox) and D045 (chat completions, Responses and a bounded file subset: list, one upload of at most 4 MiB for the assistants purpose, confirmed delete, attaching a listed file to a Responses run; retrieve, download, other purposes, vector stores, batches and fine-tuning are not offered, with reasons).",
    "Upload selection in native checks uses the fixture picker; drivers never save an Accessibility tree while an NSOpenPanel or NSSavePanel is shown. Spoken VoiceOver output is not recorded; AX roles, names and focus are inspected."
  ],
